  "statuteText": "654:20 Federal Post Card Application Form for UOCAVA Voters. –\n\nAs required by federal law, UOCAVA voters may apply to register to vote and apply for an absentee ballot using the federal official post card form prescribed by 42 U.S.C. section 1973ff(b)(2)."
